{"step_index":1779,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:20:23Z","input_tokens":2474,"cache_read_tokens":198685,"output_tokens":832,"thinking":"Constructing the template file, `instances/chatbot-template.json`. The name will be a parameter. The profile will be \"3tched-lungs.\" Defined devices are a root disk and a fuse device. Configuration will set `boot.autostart` to false and disable privileged, nested, and shift protections.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"{{INSTANCE_NAME}}\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"3tchedFS Control Plane Chatbot Identity Container Template\\\",\\n  \\\"profiles\\\": [\\n    \\\"3tched-lungs\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"config\\\": {\\n    \\\"boot.autostart\\\": \\\"false\\\",\\n    \\\"raw.lxc\\\": \\\"lxc.uts.name = {{SESSION_ID}}\\\",\\n    \\\"security.nesting\\\": \\\"false\\\",\\n    \\\"security.privileged\\\": \\\"false\\\",\\n    \\\"security.protection.shift\\\": \\\"true\\\",\\n    \\\"security.syscalls.deny\\\": \\\"ioctl errno 1 [1,0x4008941a,SCMP_CMP_MASKED_EQ,0xffffffff]\\\\nioctl errno 1 [1,0x5000940f,SCMP_CMP_MASKED_EQ,0xffffffff]\\\\nioctl errno 1 [1,0x5000943f,SCMP_CMP_MASKED_EQ,0xffffffff]\\\",\\n    \\\"security.syscalls.deny_default\\\": \\\"true\\\",\\n    \\\"user.display_name\\\": \\\"{{DISPLAY_NAME}}\\\",\\n    \\\"user.opdbus.session_id\\\": \\\"{{SESSION_ID}}\\\",\\n    \\\"user.opdbus.wireguard_public_key\\\": \\\"{{WIREGUARD_PUBKEY}}\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"devices\\\": {\\n    \\\"fuse\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"unix-char\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/dev/fuse\\\",\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/dev/fuse\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"root\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"disk\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/\\\",\\n      \\\"pool\\\": \\\"identity-roots\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/srv/git/3tched-container/instances/chatbot-template.json\""}}]}
{"step_index":1780,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:20:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T13:20:31Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T13:20:31Z\nCreated file."}
{"step_index":1781,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:20:32Z","input_tokens":2964,"cache_read_tokens":199093,"output_tokens":937,"thinking":"Creating a script to provision a device image for Cozo, specifying a destination path and size. The script will use a tool to create a sparse raw image file. This image will then be partitioned, dedicating two partitions of equal size, with the first assigned to Btrfs using a specific type.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# make-cozo-device.sh: Create a pre-formatted 20 GiB sparse leaf + Cozo store image.\\n# Layout:\\n#   p1: 10 GiB Btrfs leaf (clean for in-container `btrfs device add`)\\n#   p2: 10 GiB ext4 (pre-formatted for RocksDB/Cozo persistent store)\\nset -euo pipefail\\n\\nusage() {\\n    echo \\\"Usage: $0 <output-image-path> [total-gib (default: 20)]\\\"\\n    echo \\\"Example: $0 /var/lib/op-dbus/identity-cozo/devices/id-1.img 20\\\"\\n    exit 1\\n}\\n\\n[[ $# -ge 1 ]] || usage\\nIMAGE_PATH=$1\\nTOTAL_GIB=${2:-20}\\n\\n[[ $(id -u) -eq 0 ]] || { echo \\\"Error: Must be run as root.\\\" >&2; exit 1; }\\n\\nmkdir -p \\\"$(dirname \\\"$IMAGE_PATH\\\")\\\"\\n\\necho \\\"==> 1. Creating sparse raw image (${TOTAL_GIB} GiB) at ${IMAGE_PATH}...\\\"\\ntruncate -s \\\"${TOTAL_GIB}G\\\" \\\"${IMAGE_PATH}\\\"\\nchmod 0600 \\\"${IMAGE_PATH}\\\"\\n\\necho \\\"==> 2. Partitioning GPT: p1 (10G leaf), p2 (10G ext4 cozo)...\\\"\\nsgdisk --clear \\\\\\n    --new=1:2048:+10G --typecode=1:8300 --change-name=1:3tched-leaf \\\\\\n    --new=2:0:0       --typecode=2:8300 --change-name=2:cozo-persist \\\\\\n    \\\"${IMAGE_PATH}\\\"\\n\\necho \\\"==> 3. Attaching loop device to format p2...\\\"\\nLOOP_DEV=$(losetup --find --show --partscan \\\"${IMAGE_PATH}\\\")\\ntrap 'losetup -d \\\"${LOOP_DEV}\\\" 2>/dev/null || true' EXIT\\n\\necho \\\"==> 4. Pre-formatting partition 2 as ext4 (allocate-on-write optimized)...\\\"\\nmkfs.ext4 -F -L cozo-persist \\\\\\n    -O 64bit,dir_index,extent,sparse_super2 \\\\\\n    -m 1 \\\\\\n    \\\"${LOOP_DEV}p2\\\"\\n\\nsync\\n\\necho \\\"==> 5. Detaching loop device...\\\"\\nlosetup -d \\\"${LOOP_DEV}\\\"\\ntrap - EXIT\\n\\necho \\\"==> Done! Pre-formatted device image ready at: ${IMAGE_PATH}\\\"\\nls -lh \\\"${IMAGE_PATH}\\\"\\n\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/srv/git/3tched-container/storage/make-cozo-device.sh\""}}]}
